Four runs of measure.py on each of commit a640d96 (before, origin/main) and 9bf030a (after, the trimmed _take),
alternating before and after, each tree's src first on PYTHONPATH. Load average 5.1 at the start and at the end,
from other jobs on the 4 logical cores (uptime). The runs, in order, then the medians over them (summarize.py).

== before, run 1
